        PURCHASE_HOLD_RELEASE places and releases a Purchase hold reason (OrderHoldType OhtPurchase's enumCode), and
        PURCHASE_POLICY_EDIT keeps the buying and approval policies; SUPPLIER_SCORECARD_EDIT keeps a supplier's scorecard
        evaluations (mantle.party.SupplierServices). Granted to the Purchasing groups by the app's setup data. -->
