        teams, merges and assignment, SUPPORT_POLICY_EDIT keeps the service policies, levels and routes, SUPPORT_KNOWLEDGE_EDIT
        publishes service knowledge (KnowledgeServices), SUPPORT_CONTACT_INVITE invites a customer contact to the Support app;
        ORDER_CHANGE_REQUEST proposes a change of a placed sales order, ORDER_CHANGE_APPROVE decides it, ORDER_CHANGE_APPLY
        applies it (and places a Change hold on a sales order, hold#Order), ORDER_CHANGE_HOLD_RELEASE releases a Change hold
        (OrderHoldType OhtChange's enumCode, X4); RETURN_EXCEPTION_APPROVE decides a return outside its policy,
        RETURN_POLICY_EDIT keeps the return policies (ReturnPolicyServices), WARRANTY_APPROVE decides a warranty claim
        (WarrantyServices). RETURN_AUTHORIZE is below and CUSTOMER_CREDIT_VIEW in 10-seed/Accounting.xml. Granted to the
        Customer Service groups by the app's setup data. -->
