        import (with the permissions its target names); SALES_CONFIGURE keeps the Sales settings; SALES_OWNER_CHANGE moves a
        departing user's opportunities, accounts and open quotes (Sales' lifecycle participant, an identity operator's, F54). An
        edit permission alone reads nothing (mantle/sales/SalesAccess.js). Granted to the Sales groups by the app's setup data. -->
